    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 132,
        "text": "Hi, Daniel. Thanks for coming. We need to plan the new city health campaign. The council wants to reach more people this year.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0d7bf04757ded654ac77e446feb903ab65b5cddf48d4d8de5346c87692a5ece9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 141,
        "sourceEnd": 190,
        "text": "Sure. What do we know about last year's campaign?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "b55aff62552afbef0c084e7a92d5746d98e54280e5b802596222094484fff75a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 197,
        "sourceEnd": 344,
        "text": "Last year we focused on young adults. We reached about 2,000 people. This year we have a bigger budget, so we can reach three times as many people.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f08bacfef229dfde529a3e4246aa3c32b2609fae64dacb99f10f00951475e0e4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 353,
        "sourceEnd": 390,
        "text": "Three times as many? So 6,000 people?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5d6ff6622011375462d10dae6121676973db3304b496700bc1153c3f3ad0cd00",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 397,
        "sourceEnd": 483,
        "text": "Yes, 6,000. But the budget is only twice as big as last year's. So we must be careful.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "cf7072620d9edb50a6b574470cff7ffed70bea2191c818e4cf81a0392952bf5f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 492,
        "sourceEnd": 540,
        "text": "Right. Who should we target? Young adults again?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "86cdeb87c892b2d8c344f2a28a83cdd80b2eab693d39ae87d128767e0342ec67",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 547,
        "sourceEnd": 727,
        "text": "The data shows young adults are still important. But older people are now a larger group. Last year, people over 60 were 15 percent of the audience. This year, they are 25 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "dfde12eefa50d481a08edf2119158ac5e7f17879ca5ad5fc6e194119d66524ed",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 736,
        "sourceEnd": 791,
        "text": "That's a big change. So we should include older people.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "daf741caa70c52cba038148cfb42337387296d97075ddf06e414e11f35d9bf3f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 798,
        "sourceEnd": 947,
        "text": "Exactly. But we also need to think about families. Families with children are 30 percent of the city population now. Last year, they were 20 percent.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "517de909fc8fab3b30be6c787e7b4cf3f2d6aa7f6436f07ddb331adbbf4163d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 956,
        "sourceEnd": 1017,
        "text": "So families are one and a half times more common than before?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "282c81615d0ab7c2127802760e0439f42bf6063c4a34f6b53f18ee6cdfc3f860",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1024,
        "sourceEnd": 1103,
        "text": "Yes, that's right. One and a half times. So we need materials for families too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f0571ddd9f4da59cace67c58a33c2d2db50a853c014be02f29262e50b81df82c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1112,
        "sourceEnd": 1308,
        "text": "What about the budget for each group? Last year we spent 50 percent on young adults. This year, we plan to spend 40 percent on young adults, 30 percent on older people, and 30 percent on families.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "9bb07ed9fb2bd341f06c2a2398bd211f5b2c729665eaa4bc743a8b4f4d377a91",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1315,
        "sourceEnd": 1474,
        "text": "Good. But wait, last year we spent 50 percent on young adults and 50 percent on other groups. This year the total is 100 percent, but the groups are different.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "7c663432e5e400ffcd5b0a14e935043f5d877fe5137d509b9bd63aea6f50246a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1483,
        "sourceEnd": 1613,
        "text": "Yes. The young adult share is smaller, but the total budget is larger. So the money for young adults is still more than last year.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "cca0143ec970030fd8fa4ad88fee21895c7cd29e83ce33486a35f090b6acccad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1620,
        "sourceEnd": 1848,
        "text": "Let's check. Last year's budget was $10,000. This year it is $20,000. So 40 percent of $20,000 is $8,000. Last year, 50 percent of $10,000 was $5,000. So we are spending more on young adults, even though the percentage is lower.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "0e66e02c2b262547f1f291b10122063f66a8025eca946b723d751e8fc3b32ef5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1857,
        "sourceEnd": 1926,
        "text": "That's interesting. The percentage went down, but the amount went up.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "c8f314abc0c82030f11fa86690c848f4cc26dda026449e7ea4a958ffd93efdeb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1933,
        "sourceEnd": 1988,
        "text": "Exactly. We need to explain that clearly in the report.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f7e2b4bb0ba71b63c8a075333ec49ff7a8d560aabb9dd131844f158a02d6640b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 1997,
        "sourceEnd": 2131,
        "text": "What about the number of events? Last year we had 10 events. This year we plan to have 15 events. That's one and a half times as many.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "c3ca1972c892b7b1f79cd534b11e8b24fc257798b449e84b8c54e0d411dcf88d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2138,
        "sourceEnd": 2278,
        "text": "Yes. And we want more people at each event. Last year, about 200 people came to each event. This year, we hope for 300 people at each event.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f35b2033b131aeda5c34abaf3e7e7b9642998c3635c56f2bd24d5b3776186ba7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2287,
        "sourceEnd": 2365,
        "text": "So 15 events times 300 people is 4,500 people. But we said 6,000 people total.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "408c6a2807021d37d461c96b592f74f2d4e3e3e89a6ed54f80fffe7f2d5ab634",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2372,
        "sourceEnd": 2481,
        "text": "Right. The 6,000 includes online reach. Online reach was 1,000 last year. This year we hope for 1,500 online.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "20f17f47b7c1d03e0ee91faaee976a7ec014d052741944f281b24b367e9e4758",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2490,
        "sourceEnd": 2548,
        "text": "So 4,500 at events plus 1,500 online is 6,000. That works.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "525a5755b5a39c033a85f68c05857b2d44e474294f753dbe60195c88685ff36f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2555,
        "sourceEnd": 2592,
        "text": "Good. Now, who will write the report?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2b3c2b0d3c9663cea61559e557b861747aa9fe541cd5055345a8db613f915c00",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2601,
        "sourceEnd": 2646,
        "text": "I can write it. But I need the exact numbers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5002bb4577cab57e52489bfaf02f80b52edcf861df4f65744d17a4f72be74531",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2653,
        "sourceEnd": 2720,
        "text": "I'll send them today. And remember, the campaign starts next month.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "3431a88c1f3ba8dd8078df6de4b9ee9bb9e0a5d6a7c1c354e35cdc7a239e0ff8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 2729,
        "sourceEnd": 2767,
        "text": "Got it. I'll start the draft tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "861dff407753939ef7d63920c6b79ee47f060d03d034d1eb00e1e89a6badd368",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
